id=netstats-fix-lite
name=Network Stats Fix (Proxy Only - Lite)
version=v14-lite
versionCode=14
author=Hirbod-JORFlint
description=Lightweight fix for broken traffic indicator. No BPF restoration - safe for devices where BPF causes 'no internet'. Native binder proxy v6.0 with AIDL metadata support, netstats XML file injection to /data/misc/netstats/, background stats updater, comprehensive SELinux policy. Handles all ROM variants. Extensive logging for debugging.
